1. Nâng version playwright bằng cách sửa trực tiếp file như sau:

rong file package.json -> "@playwright/test": "^1.63.0"

Nếu sửa playwright sang version khác, vd version lớn hơn: 1.65.0
-> dùng lệnh: npx playwright --version

thì sau đó cần chạy lại các lệnh:
- npm install --> để cài đặt lại tất các thư viện
- npx playwright install --> để cài đặt các trình duyệt playwright tương ứng với version của playwright

2. Nâng version playwright bằng câu lệnh
- npm install -D @playwright/test@latest

3. Để cài đặt 1 trình duyệt playwright cụ thể thì dùng lệnh sau:
- npx playwright install chromium firefox webkit --> có thể 1 hoặc nhiều

npx playwright test --list

npm install -D dotenv

ENV=staging CLASS=pwa103 npx playwright test

ENV=production npx playwright test tests/lesson-01/06-env-management-utils.spec.ts // ko mở trình duyệt

ENV=production npx playwright test tests/lesson-01/06-env-management-utils.spec.ts --headed // có mở trình duyệt


npm install                     → Cài đặt thư viện đang có trong file package.json
npm install <ten_thu_vien>

npx <> <>   // x: execute
 - npx ts-node <file>
 - npx tsx <file>
 - npx playwright test .......
